  "description": "<p>The Inexa Pro is a fitness tool that helps users reach their goals by allowing them to track key metrics like muscle mass, fat percentage, bone density etc.</p>\r\n<p>It does this by using 4 electrodes at the hands and at the feet to transmit an electrical current through the body. Fat, muscle, water and bone affect the waves in different ways so the reading of the waves on the recieving end allows the scale to provide an accurate reading of the user's body composition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This product is aesthetically pleasing and easy to use. The website currently converts over 2% of the traffic it receives. The AOV is $93.03 and this scale turns out beautifully in videos. Let me know if you'd like to work together! My email is Inexa.global@gmail.com</p>",
